#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:4
msgid "sbt 2.0 changes (draft)"
msgstr "sbt 2.0 变更（草稿）"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:7
msgid "Changes with compatibility implications"
msgstr "涉及兼容性的变更"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:10
msgid "See also [Migrating from sbt 1.x](./migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md)."
msgstr "另请参阅 [从 sbt 1.x 迁移](./migrating-from-sbt-1.x.md)。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:12
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Scala 3 in metabuild**. sbt 2.x build.sbt DSL, used for build definitions "
"and plugins, is based on Scala 3.x (currently **3.8.3**)  (Both sbt 1.x and "
"2.x are capable of building Scala 2.x and 3.x) by [@eed3si9n](https://"
"github.com/eed3si9n), [@adpi2](https://github.com/adpi2), and others."
msgstr ""
"**元构建中的 Scala 3**。sbt 2.x 的 build.sbt DSL 用于构建定义和插件，基于 "
"Scala 3.x（当前为 **3.8.1**）。（sbt 1.x 和 2.x 均能构建 Scala 2.x 和 3.x）"
"由 [@eed3si9n](https://github.com/eed3si9n)、[@adpi2](https://github.com/"
"adpi2) 等贡献。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:13
msgid ""
"**Common settings**. Bare settings are added to all subprojects, as opposed "
"to just the root subproject, and thus replacing the role that `ThisBuild` "
"has played."
msgstr ""
"**通用设置**。裸设置会添加到所有子项目，而不仅仅是根子项目，从而取代 "
"`ThisBuild` 所扮演的角色。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:14
msgid ""
"**Incremental test**. `test` task is changed to be incremental test that can "
"cache test results. Use `testFull` for full test by [@eed3si9n](https://"
"github.com/eed3si9n) in [\\#7686](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7686)"
msgstr ""
"**增量测试**。`test` 任务已改为可缓存测试结果的增量测试。使用 `testFull` 进行"
"完整测试，由 [@eed3si9n](https://github.com/eed3si9n) 在 [\\#7686](https://"
"github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7686) 中贡献"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:15
msgid ""
"**Cached task**. All tasks are cached by default. Details in [Caching](../"
"concepts/caching.md)."
msgstr ""
"**缓存任务**。默认情况下所有任务都会被缓存。详见 [Caching](../concepts/"
"caching.md)。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:16
msgid ""
"**Depedency tree**. `dependencyTree` tasks are unified to one input task by "
"[@eed3si9n](https://github.com/eed3si9n) in [\\#8199](https://github.com/sbt/"
"sbt/pull/8199)"
msgstr ""
"**依赖树**。`dependencyTree` 任务已统一为一个输入任务，由 [@eed3si9n]"
"(https://github.com/eed3si9n) 在 [\\#8199](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/"
"8199) 中贡献"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:17
msgid ""
"`test` task type is changed from `Unit` to `TestResult` by [@eed3si9n]"
"(https://github.com/eed3si9n) in [\\#8181](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/"
"8181)"
msgstr ""
"`test` 任务类型已从 `Unit` 改为 `TestResult`，由 [@eed3si9n](https://"
"github.com/eed3si9n) 在 [\\#8181](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/8181) 中贡"
"献"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:18
msgid ""
"Default settings and tasks keys typed to `URL` (i.e. `apiMappings`, "
"`apiURL`, `homepage`, `organizationHomepage`, `releaseNotesURL`) were "
"changed to `URI` in [\\#7927](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7927)."
msgstr ""
"类型为 `URL` 的默认设置和任务键（即 `apiMappings`、`apiURL`、`homepage`、"
"`organizationHomepage`、`releaseNotesURL`）已改为 `URI`，见 [\\#7927]"
"(https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7927)。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:19
msgid ""
"`licenses` key is changed from `Seq[(String, URL)]` to `Seq[License]` in "
"[\\#7927](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7927)."
msgstr ""
"`licenses` 键已从 `Seq[(String, URL)]` 改为 `Seq[License]`，见 [\\#7927]"
"(https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7927)。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:20
msgid ""
"sbt 2.x plugins are published with `_sbt2_3` suffix by [@eed3si9n](https://"
"github.com/eed3si9n) in [\\#7671](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7671)"
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x 插件以 `_sbt2_3` 后缀发布，由 [@eed3si9n](https://github.com/"
"eed3si9n) 在 [\\#7671](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/7671) 中贡献"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:21
msgid ""
"sbt 2.x adds `platform` setting so `ModuleID`'s `%%` operator can cross "
"build on JVM as well as JS and Native, as opposed to `%%%` operator that was "
"created in a plugin to workaround this issue, by [@eed3si9n](https://"
"github.com/eed3si9n) in [\\#6746](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/6746)"
msgstr ""
"sbt 2.x 添加了 `platform` 设置，使 `ModuleID` 的 `%%` 运算符可以在 JVM、JS "
"和 Native 上进行交叉构建，而无需使用插件中为规避此问题而创建的 `%%%` 运算符，"
"由 [@eed3si9n](https://github.com/eed3si9n) 在 [\\#6746](https://github.com/"
"sbt/sbt/pull/6746) 中贡献"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:22
msgid ""
"Dropped `useCoursier` setting so Coursier cannot be opted out, by [@eed3si9n]"
"(https://github.com/eed3si9n) in [\\#7712](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/"
"7712)"
msgstr ""
"移除了 `useCoursier` 设置，因此无法选择不使用 Coursier，由 [@eed3si9n]"
"(https://github.com/eed3si9n) 在 [\\#7712](https://github.com/sbt/sbt/pull/"
"7712) 中贡献"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:23
msgid ""
"`Key.Classpath` is changed to be an alias of the "
"`Seq[Attributed[xsbti.HashedVirtualFileRef]]` type, instead of "
"`Seq[Attributed[File]]`. Similarly, some task keys that used to return "
"`File` have changed to return `HashedVirtualFileRef` instead. See [Caching "
"Files](../concepts/caching.md#caching-files)."
msgstr ""
"`Key.Classpath` 已改为 `Seq[Attributed[xsbti.HashedVirtualFileRef]]` 类型的别"
"名，而非 `Seq[Attributed[File]]`。同样，一些曾返回 `File` 的任务键已改为返回 "
"`HashedVirtualFileRef`。详见 [Caching Files](../concepts/caching.md#caching-"
"files)。"

#: src/reference/changes/sbt-2.0-change-summary.md:24
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In sbt 2.x `target` defaults to `target/out/jvm/scala-3.8.2/<subproject>/`, "
